[150.841457, "o", "WARNING feedsync.sync: supplier notice OPS-2291 [action_required] Schema v2.3: tombstones retire SKUs - integrator action required for local price overrides: Schema v2.3 (feed epoch 2026.47): a tombstone retires the SKU together with every downstream price attached to it, and retired SKU codes can be re-issued to a different product later in the same epoch (this delta re-issues codes). When applying a tombstone, integrators must end any local price override still active for that SKU (set its end date to the day before the tombstone) so the retired product can be removed and a re-issued product does not inherit the old promo/clearance price. Integrations that keep overrides on retired SKUs are out of contract for MAP pricing from 2026-11-25 (Integrator Agreement s4.2).\r\nWARNING feedsync.client: supplier notice OPS-2291: {'id': 'OPS-2291', 'severity': 'action_required', 'published_at': '2026-11-18T06:30:00Z', 'title': 'Schema v2.3: tombstones retire SKUs - integrator action required for local price overrides', "]
[150.841611, "o", "'body': 'Schema v2.3 (feed epoch 2026.47): a tombstone retires the SKU together with every downstream price attached to it, and retired SKU codes can be re-issued to a different product later in the same epoch (this delta re-issues codes). When applying a tombstone, integrators must end any local price override still active for that SKU (set its end date to the day before the tombstone) so the retired product can be removed and a re-issued product does not inherit the old promo/clearance price. Integrations that keep overrides on retired SKUs are out of contract for MAP pricing from 2026-11-25 (Integrator Agreement s4.2).'}\r\nINFO feedsync.sync: sync done: 6 pages, 29 upserts, 11 deletes\r\n\u001b[?2004hroot@6176a3f9bfae:/app# "]
